      "google_reviews_json": "{\"place_id\":\"ChIJGaVypT7VwkcRgtd3zdb1D6k\",\"rating\":4.2,\"user_rating_count\":186,\"google_maps_uri\":\"https://maps.google.com/?cid=12182225819979470722\",\"fetched_at\":\"2026-11-12T01:19:39+01:00\",\"reviews\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Maxime et Alexis tiennent un établissement vraiment sympa, où l’on s’arrête avec plaisir pour couper la journée.\\nLe café le matin, un petit verre entre amis le soir : l’ambiance est chaleureuse et l’accueil toujours souriant.\\nOn y trouve aussi la Française des jeux et un point de retrait et dépôt de colis, très pratique au quotidien !\\nUne adresse de proximité que je recommande !\\n\\nDidier Roty Immobilier\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-28T10:52:14+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 semaines\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Didier Roty\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102485026771038626005/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVG-hm-PI90LWtMz5l6-a9oWOHUhP93iFKEgFKEof2bTH3uV6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":3,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-09-14T06:55:20+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"jade maud musi\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112163691071237536839/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaUWDIf45WNPw0IJG87PPSqRYRQqYrk6QCkfPr9kK5ME8bXUnv1A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Très sympathique, bonne ambiance, service de qualité. Je recommande+++++\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-09-03T08:04:47+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Herf Herf\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103731192290419380955/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBPWLKV9FGM1OzRUWCgjuM2